ndia.indiatimes.com/india/stop-it-get-lost-chaos-erupts-at-cjps-abhijeet-dipke-neha-boras-joint-presser-video/articleshow/134964498.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-15T16:01:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134964742,imgsize-184580.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['All for one man': CJP's Dipke targets Centre for sweeping curbs to stamp out anti-CEC protests]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/all-for-one-man-cjps-dipke-targets-centre-for-sweeping-curbs-to-stamp-out-anti-cec-protests/articleshow/134964724.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134964724.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[CJP activist Abhijeet Dipke has accused the government of detaining protesters for chief election commissioner Gyanesh Kumar. He claimed that students and opposition leaders faced police action while protesting in Delhi. Rail services were reportedly suspended, and Metro stations were closed during the demonstrations. Neha Bora from All India Students' Association expressed her concerns about the treatment of journalists covering the events.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/all-for-one-man-cjps-dipke-targets-centre-for-sweeping-curbs-to-stamp-out-anti-cec-protests/articleshow/134964724.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/all-for-one-man-cjps-dipke-targets-centre-for-sweeping-curbs-to-stamp-out-anti-cec-protests/articleshow/134964724.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-15T15:58:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pranjal Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134964768,imgsize-149562.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Supreme Court issues notice on SIR petition, 