age/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134963734,imgsize-114557.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Growing concern over anti-India hate in US': MEA demands probe into Hindu temple attack plot]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/growing-concern-over-anti-india-hate-in-us-mea-demands-probe-into-hindu-temple-attack-plot/articleshow/134962943.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134962943.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The ministry of external affairs (MEA) has raised concerns about an alleged conspiracy aimed at a Hindu temple in the US. It called for a comprehensive investigation came following the arrest of Alexandros Paporakis in Illinois, accused of plotting a mass shooting driven at a Hindu temple in Aurora, Illinois. Authorities uncovered alarming evidence tied to extremist views at his residence, leading the MEA to demand justice and advocate for community safety measures.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/growing-concern-over-anti-india-hate-in-us-mea-demands-probe-into-hindu-temple-attack-plot/articleshow/134962943.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/growing-concern-over-anti-india-hate-in-us-mea-demands-probe-into-hindu-temple-attack-plot/articleshow/134962943.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-15T15:14:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134963533,imgsize-42834.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Serious allegations': SC hears pleas on sexual harassment of women journalists, attacks on children among protest-related petitions]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/serious-allegations-sc-hears-pleas-on-sexual-harassment-of-women-journalists-attacks-on-children-among-prot